{"version":1,"key":"card:551","content":{"id":551,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"7b3b4bd1-bf1f-453f-bf08-dc63ad2f0abb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"回顾笔记的建议和实践："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"5cb332ad-066e-4ffb-9f28-cd13f76b1f80","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"2bf3b492-a7eb-4902-982d-e024d338102b","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"c0fa0270-19ae-45e4-bc20-83ddac2a30f3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"投入时间"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"49db165f-cff3-4660-92d9-9cc1e0b9fffe","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"很多人都觉得回顾很有必要性，但是都说没时间做，这明显是借口，因为不存在没时间，只存在优先级，还是没把这件事情作为重要的事情来对待。"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"40407798-b7e6-4a66-9d05-0a8bef6e1c34","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"181b53be-1459-48e5-a4be-5186fd54dc3d","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"5397e049-d371-40fc-b7b5-f84427106477","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"输入前，大致分好类之后，查阅相关类比的笔记，寻找联系，这是一个回顾的时机"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"3dbe7248-318d-49a2-822c-a475d7f4d9f9","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"c2257f03-5d25-448b-bc5d-f8a49ea9e11e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"每日，隔日回顾，处理临时笔记，临时的想法，未消化的内容，未建立的新连接"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"836047f4-8369-4f94-b13d-d4950ae0ffcc","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"118da010-f240-4b19-a294-b67eda381c37","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"每周，每月回顾，这种长周期的回顾是为了发现笔记间的新联系，对笔记产生新思考后的重新归类"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"4a1a674a-3153-431c-82ac-47a9ac1746f4","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"ea6ebb58-16af-42f4-926d-d310f6cde663","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"启动思考"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"2af348c7-93a8-4e39-ba49-3dc0b932442d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"回顾并不是去背诵笔记的内容，而是在回顾笔记时启发思考，要启发思考最简单的办法就是问问题，举个例子："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"c366205f-fafb-405e-be4c-769e10f484e9","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"6d02b7fe-8496-4616-9bc6-d868c9bb3c6a","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"86ea9d7f-ac07-4f7e-bf4e-5f9f8d26d13d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对我现在正在解决的问题有什么帮助？"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"3c506ed9-e2ce-413a-a2fa-b250eda1cc9d","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"46077a13-1b5f-4235-b754-2694f4186851","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我可以补充什么新的实践或新的思考？"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"75e8424a-5788-4c67-9017-8a049b0ac5c6","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"35620f21-1801-4b16-9b10-b17aa9d1a54a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"和已有笔记的联系是什么？"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"c52a4bf7-f0d6-47ef-b894-75e4e0c4e60f","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"35734346-68b4-4934-8890-11b2667628d7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"进行互动"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"8009f351-2c11-47a2-b5a1-94eb764a4fdc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"回顾也是整理笔记的一个时机，当触发了新的思考时，或者有更深刻的理解时，也需要对已有的笔记进行修改，笔记不是一成不变的，而是在不断发展的（这也为输入减少了负担，我们不追求写下的笔记都是完美的，笔记应当是不断发展的）"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"4b30f26c-a178-4db4-a9e7-3e687931fa8f","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"5284a053-5e02-4476-a3b4-4855861a6a45","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"9abc65b2-fc6c-4093-90cb-9ea9e4e264e9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"增：新实践、新想法、新联系"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"a781a257-88d5-4f2d-bcc2-82767b196097","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"e142df4d-a458-4a85-94f3-414e11795143","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"改：非文法、语法上的修改或扩写，而是在理解消化后用自己的理解进行修改"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"71c8e439-7cfa-490a-a460-3c78387b9745","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"7fdee35e-e59d-42a5-bd97-07857cc9ee8a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"删：对于不在关注的领域，归档或者及时清理，减少心智负担，对于单篇笔记，有了更深刻的理解，可以使用更精炼的语句进行表达，删除不必要的部分"}]}]}]}]}]}],"tags":["读书/笔记的方法","学习方法"],"createTime":1743904829242,"updateTime":1792337069154,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1792337069154}}